he octanol layer to that in the aqueous layer [log P = log ([Pt]WSO/[Pt]OSW)·(1/10)] = log ([Pt]stock-[Pt]OSW)/[Pt]OSW)·(1/10)]."}],"ccdc":["GALYAT01"]}